1. Name 5 IT job roles and write one line about what each role does.

        Software Developer – Develops, codes, and maintains software applications according to requirements.
        Software Tester – Tests software to find bugs and ensures that the application works correctly.
        UI/UX Designer – Designs the user interface and improves the overall user experience of an application or website.
        Data Analyst – Collects, analyzes, and interprets data to help organizations make better decisions.
        AI Engineer – Develops and implements artificial intelligence and machine learning systems to solve real-world problems.


